  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">All Loot Drops 是一款極簡風格的模組，讓實體總是會掉落可自訂數量的所有可能戰利品。所有戰利品掉落會在首次載入時程式化生成，因此任何擁有戰利品表的模組實體皆相容。提供設定選項可調整掉落數量，以及是否啟用「抢夺」附魔的效果。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 額外組合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>keepOriginalLootQuantityIfHigher</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果例如鐵傀儡掉落的鐵比預設 lootQuantity 設定還多，則保留該原始數量，而不進行削弱。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>lootQuantity</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1，最小 1，最大 128</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">決定每個生物掉落的戰利品數量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>lootingEnchantAffectsQuantity</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，「抢夺」附魔有機率增加掉落戰利品的數量。每級別會根據 'lootingEnchantExtraQuantityChancePerLevel' 的機率進行判定。若判定成功，則在戰利品總量上加 1。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>lootingEnchantExtraQuantityChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.5，最小 0，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">判定成功為總掉落量加 1 的機率。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"說明\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>簡易說明</strong></span><br>預設情況下，女巫的掉落表如下：玻璃瓶（12.5% 機率）、閃光粉塵（12.5% 機率）、火藥（12.5% 機率）、紅石粉（12.5% 機率）、蜘蛛眼（12.5% 機率）、糖（12.5% 機率）和木棍（25% 機率）。<br>啟用此模組後，只要實體掉落戰利品，您就一定會獲得<strong><em>lootQuantity</em></strong> 份的該物品。<br>如果用於擊殺實體的劍附有「抢夺」附魔，則每附魔一級就有<em><strong>lootingEnchantExtraQuantityChance</strong></em> 的機率使掉落量增加 1。</p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組，只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
